==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{confix|hyper|opia|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A disorder of the vision where the eye focusses images behind the [[retina]] instead of on it, so that distant objects can be seen better than near objects.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|farsightedness}}
* {{l|en|hypermetropia}}
* {{l|en|hypermetropy}}

